{"seq":3,"slug":"a-universal-genius","title":"全才","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/john-von-neumann/core-contributions/a-universal-genius","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"contributions-to-mathematics","title":"对数学的贡献","url":"/c/people/john-von-neumann/core-contributions/a-universal-genius/contributions-to-mathematics","wordCount":1726,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"quantum-mechanics-and-beyond","title":"量子力学及其他","url":"/c/people/john-von-neumann/core-contributions/a-universal-genius/quantum-mechanics-and-beyond","wordCount":1682,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 全才\n\n本章呈现冯·诺依曼作为一位旷世全才的广博贡献。冯·诺依曼，首先是一位伟大的数学家，在数学的众多领域做出了重要贡献；他更横跨物理学、生物学等众多领域，是一位罕见的全才。两篇文档，分别呈现对数学的贡献，以及量子力学及其他。\n"}